WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.399
HS=HR is a moderately crazy Game of Thrones
theory claiming that the current High Septon

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:09.850
is actually Howland Reed.
So Howland Reed is the Lord of Greywater Watch,

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:14.820
in the Neck, a region full of swamps and bogs
and inhabited by people called the crannogmen.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.810
The actual castle of Greywater Watch is built
on an artificial island that floats around

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:23.829
the Neck – what you could call Howl’s
Moving Castle. Howland is the father of Meera

00:00:23.829 --> 00:00:27.730
and Jojen Reed, the siblings that Bran is
travelling with, and back in the day, Howland

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.909
was a close friend of Eddard Stark. They fought
together in Robert’s Rebellion, and Ned

00:00:31.909 --> 00:00:37.340
says Howland saved his life at the Tower of
Joy. In fact, Howland is now the last survivor

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:42.250
of the fight at the Tower of Joy, and so is,
as far as we know, the last person alive who

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:48.080
knows that Jon is the son of Rhaegar and Lyanna.
But despite all this Howland hype, Lord Reed

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:52.650
hasn’t done anything in the story so far.
Robb speaks of “the worth of Howland Reed”,

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.870
and sends him some letters during the war,
but none of it results in action. George R.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:01.570
R. Martin has said that Howland “will appear
eventually”, so the question is when and

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:04.850
how.
The High Septon is the leader of the Faith

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:09.940
of the Seven, the dominant religion in Westeros.
The High Septon is usually elected by a council

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.720
of high-ranking clergy, at which point they
stop using their old name, start wearing a

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:18.280
funny hat, and are considered God’s voice
on Earth – so basically the Pope. Since

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:22.210
High Septons don’t use individual names,
it can be hard to tell them apart, but in

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.260
the Song so far we’ve seen three – the
fat one, who was killed in the Riot of King's

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.370
Landing, then a replacement who was installed
by Tyrion and murdered by Osney Kettleblack

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:35.659
for Cersei. And then the third High Septon, who is really something different. Rather than being

00:01:35.659 --> 00:01:40.229
installed as a pawn of nobility, he was swept
into power on the shoulders of a popular religious

00:01:40.229 --> 00:01:45.020
movement of common people who call themselves
Sparrows. The Sparrows are outraged by the

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:49.260
destruction and horror caused by the wars
of squabbling kings, especially that inflicted

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:53.560
on people of the Faith. They’re angry with
the nobility and especially the Crown who

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:57.979
have abandoned them. So unlike the last couple
of High Septons, this so-called High Sparrow

00:01:57.979 --> 00:02:02.040
seems to actually be deeply devout, and he
advocates the interests of the Faith and the

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:05.299
common people in ways that his predecessors
did not.

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:10.229
So HS=HR claims that this new High Septon,
the High Sparrow, is actually secretly Howland

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:15.670
Reed. The obvious question here is why Lord
Reed would want to be High Septon. One reason

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:19.459
is that being High Septon would allow him
to strike back at the people who destroyed

00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:23.930
the Starks. The crannogmen are known to be
“stout allies of the Starks”, and Howland

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:28.599
would be particularly outraged by the killing
of his friend Ned. Indeed, the High Sparrow

00:02:28.599 --> 00:02:33.020
brings up Eddard’s execution to Cersei,
condemning the killing with strong words – though

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:37.470
any bloodshed on the steps of a Sept would
likely upset the High Septon. In any case

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:42.300
Howland may be using the position of High
Septon to gain power and take vengeance. The

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:47.170
High Sparrow does gain a great deal of power
– he successfully negotiates for the reinstatement

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:51.709
of the two military orders of the Faith – the
Warrior’s Sons and the Poor Fellows, collectively

00:02:51.709 --> 00:02:55.940
referred to as the Faith Militant. The High
Sparrow was willing to trade away almost a

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:00.620
million gold pieces owed to the Faith to achieve
this, which does suggest a preference for

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:05.170
short-term power rather than the long-term
betterment of the Faith. The High Sparrow

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:10.330
goes on to arrest Margaery Tyrell and torture
Osney Kettleblack, then has Cersei imprisoned,

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:14.830
and sent on a politically and emotionally
crushing walk of shame. He also refuses to

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:19.569
anoint Tommen, an important ritual for the
boy King’s legitimisation. So the High Sparrow

00:03:19.569 --> 00:03:24.599
has already inflicted a lot of damage to the
Lannister regime, but he could do much more.

00:03:24.599 --> 00:03:28.540
It’s hard to overstate how powerful the
High Sparrow is becoming – everyone from

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:32.500
hedge knights to smallfolk to Lancel Lannister
are signing up to fight for him, in the heart

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:37.470
of King’s Landing, at a time when the Crown
is weak and unstable – Tywin and Kevan are

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:40.860
dead, most of the Lannister soldiers are off
with Jamie, the King’s a boy, the Small

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.810
Council’s incompetent, Cersei’s imploding,
and the masses are rising at the Sparrow’s

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.790
command. We don’t yet know what the High
Septon will do with all that power, but if

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:52.769
he is Howland Reed, the next steps could well
be finishing off the Lannisters, perhaps even

00:03:52.769 --> 00:03:57.150
taking control of King’s Landing and the
Iron Throne. It might also involve revealing

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:02.390
to Westeros the secret of Jon Snow’s parentage.
As the son of Rhaegar Targaryen, Jon could

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:06.220
conceivably make a claim on the Iron Throne
– especially if the Lannisters are ousted

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:10.849
beforehand. That is of course a big claim,
which to be realised would require the support

00:04:10.849 --> 00:04:16.079
of someone very influential. The High Sparrow
could be that someone. He increasingly holds

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:19.940
the hearts and minds of the common people
of Westeros and has “Kings and high lords

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:24.479
[dancing] to [his] twittering”. Howland
Reed, as High Septon, would be perfectly placed

00:04:24.479 --> 00:04:27.960
to spread word of and support for Jon’s
claim.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:33.090
So what actual evidence do we have that Howland
Reed and the High Sparrow are the same person?

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:36.860
One thing is that the High Sparrow’s appearance
matches that of the Reeds and of the crannogmen

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:41.160
generally. The High Sparrow is described as
short and thin, with “hair tied … in a

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:46.300
… knot behind his head”. Howland’s children
are described with striking similarity – Meera

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:50.030
is “slim … with … hair knotted behind
her head”, and “both Reeds [are] slight

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:54.460
of build, slender … and scarcely taller
than Bran”. The High Sparrow looks like

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:59.720
a Reed. Further, the High Sparrow has “eyes
as brown as mud”, and is said to have been

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:04.060
“born with filth beneath his fingernails”,
alluding to the mud that's associated with

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:09.370
crannogmen, who Little Walder Frey calls “mudmen”.
Further, crannogmen are known to use sneaky

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:14.490
tactics. Bran says they prefer to hide from
foes rather than face them in open battle.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:19.100
Little Walder Frey calls them sneaks, and
says “you never see them, but they see you”.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:23.669
The World of Ice and Fire says they’re “small,
sly [and] secretive”. All of this stuff seems

00:05:23.669 --> 00:05:29.380
very consistent with a tactic of infiltration
to indirectly attack enemies and reveal secrets.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:34.419
Also, crannogmen seem to be connected to greensight
and other magical powers. The World of Ice

00:05:34.419 --> 00:05:38.320
and Fire suggests that crannogmen were “close
to the children of the forest” and might

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.139
even have intermarried with them, which could
explain their small stature, as well as the

00:05:42.139 --> 00:05:47.320
green eyes and greensight that we see in Jojen.
If the crannogmen have magical insight, they

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:52.430
may, as Maester Luwin suggests, “have secret
knowledge”. When Meera and Jojen swear Greywater

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:57.580
Watch to Winterfell, they use an unusual oath,
swearing “by ice and fire” – which alludes

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:02.949
to Jon’s Stark and Targaryen blood. So maybe
the Reeds, perhaps through Jojen, know about

00:06:02.949 --> 00:06:06.139
Jon’s importance as the Prince that was
Promised, or a head of the dragon with three

00:06:06.139 --> 00:06:10.570
heads, or Azor Ahai, or whatever prophecy
you want to use to indicate his great magical

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:14.360
importance. It’s unclear how this could
connect to Jojen and Bran and the Three-Eyed

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:18.759
Raven, but it seems possible that Howland
Reed knows something about Jon’s significance,

00:06:18.759 --> 00:06:24.169
which may motivate his ploy to play High Sparrow.
And one very quick last thing is this quote

00:06:24.169 --> 00:06:29.789
from Varys – power, sneaky shit, small man,
large shadow – but yeah moving on.

00:06:29.789 --> 00:06:35.130
So, there is some evidence – if vague evidence
– for HS=HR. But there are also problems.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.919
First is Howland’s absence from the Neck.
The High Sparrow has been spending a great

00:06:38.919 --> 00:06:43.380
deal of time walking around Westeros, gathering
support, building up the movement of Sparrows.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.350
If Howland has been absent from his home all this
time, who’s leading his people in this time

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:51.699
of war? His kids have wondered off beyond
the Wall and could be dead for all he knows.

00:06:51.699 --> 00:06:56.050
His wife Jyana is presumably still at Greywater,
governing, perhaps, but we really know nothing

00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:00.919
about her. Things are only getting crazier
up North, with Baratheons, Boltons, ironmen,

00:07:00.919 --> 00:07:05.090
clansmen, wildlings, Others… surely Howland
couldn’t abandon his family and people at

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:08.639
a time like this.
Another problem is that of a Northman becoming

00:07:08.639 --> 00:07:13.330
High Septon. In the North, people follow the
Old Gods, not the Seven. And the closeness

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:17.289
of the crannogmen to the Children of the Forest
and the magic of the Old Gods further separates

00:07:17.289 --> 00:07:21.699
them from the new Faith. The High Sparrow
surely has demonstrated a deep religiosity

00:07:21.699 --> 00:07:26.419
and knowledge of the Faith – he says he “tended
to half a hundred little villages … performing

00:07:26.419 --> 00:07:31.500
marriages, absolving sinners of their sins,
naming newborn children”. How could a Northman,

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:35.720
someone from an extremely different culture,
convincingly perform all this religious service,

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:40.069
let alone become the ultimate religious leader
of the Faith? Howland being High Septon is

00:07:40.069 --> 00:07:44.840
like a Buddhist becoming Pope, or a Jew becoming
an Imam. It’s conceivable that Howland has

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:49.610
studied the Faith of the Seven, or follows
it even, secretly, I guess, but – it’s

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.840
all very implausible.
Ultimately the biggest problem with HS=HR

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.340
is that it doesn’t make sense as a plan.
For the theory to be true, Howland must have

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:02.240
sat down one day, during the War, with winter
coming, and decided that the best plan of

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:06.610
action was for him to go wander the Riverlands,
on foot, performing religious service for

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:11.539
a foreign religion, until he manages to become
the leader of a popular uprising, and then become

00:08:11.539 --> 00:08:16.150
the High Septon, a position with power sufficient
to strike at the crown or support Jon Snow

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:21.870
– all the while hiding his identity and
faking faith. Like, seriously? And the plan

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.560
relies not only on a popular movement that
Howland surely couldn’t have predicted or

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:30.280
single-handedly created, but also on a degree
of political instability that not even Littlefinger

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:34.089
accurately predicted.
It would make far more sense for Howland to

00:08:34.089 --> 00:08:38.619
stay in the North. That way he could protect
his family and homeland from the increasingly

00:08:38.619 --> 00:08:42.619
bloody war in the North and strike against
the Boltons who betrayed Robb and perpetrated

00:08:42.619 --> 00:08:46.829
the Red Wedding. He might not be able to support
Jon’s claim on the Throne, but he could

00:08:46.829 --> 00:08:52.249
support Jon’s claim on the North. In a Catelyn
chapter of A Storm of Swords, Robb names Jon

00:08:52.249 --> 00:08:57.100
his heir as King in the North. Right after,
Robb sends Maege Mormont and Galbart Glover

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:01.329
with a letter to Howland Reed. So assuming
they made it, Howland probably knows that

00:09:01.329 --> 00:09:05.410
Jon is the heir to the North, as well as the
son of Rhaegar. It may be that he’s been

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:09.059
working with Maege and Galbart ever since,
which would explain where the three have been

00:09:09.059 --> 00:09:13.369
all this time. Staying in the North wouldn’t
help Howland strike at King’s Landing, but

00:09:13.369 --> 00:09:17.540
would a reclusive crannogman really prioritise
attacking a distant capital over protecting

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:22.249
his home? The only real disadvantage to staying
in the North is that it couldn’t allow Howland

00:09:22.249 --> 00:09:27.540
to dramatically reveal R+L=J to the realm
– but George R. R. Martin is already setting

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:31.009
up for that revelation to happen in a very
different way.

00:09:31.009 --> 00:09:35.999
Jon’s parentage is probably going to be
revealed with Bran’s magical powers. In

00:09:35.999 --> 00:09:40.379
A Dance with Dragons, Bran has visions of
past events that happened in front of weirwood

00:09:40.379 --> 00:09:44.879
trees. Now – we know that Northern marriage
customs involve a ceremony in front of a weirwood

00:09:44.879 --> 00:09:49.600
tree, and we know that just before the Rebellion,
Rhaegar and Lyanna were at (or at least very

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:53.679
near) the Isle of Faces, which is the site
of the only weirwood grove south of the Neck

00:09:53.679 --> 00:09:58.610
and which has been named by George R. R. Martin as somewhere that will “come to the fore in later books”.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:03.360
George R. R. Martin is setting up for Bran to have a vision of Rhaegar and Lyanna’s secret marriage

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:08.029
at the Isle of Faces, which presumably would
lead to a revelation of Jon’s parentage.

00:10:08.029 --> 00:10:12.529
It’s almost foreshadowed by Bran’s unwitting
discovery of Cersei and Jamie’s incest – he

00:10:12.529 --> 00:10:16.329
saw a relationship that he wasn’t supposed
to, with big implications for the parentage

00:10:16.329 --> 00:10:20.720
of the star-crossed lovers’ children. So
we don’t need some complicated and implausible

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:26.829
contrivance to reveal R+L=J – Bran’s
visions are already about to do it. Admittedly,

00:10:26.829 --> 00:10:31.529
while Bran’s visions could reveal R+L=J
to Bran and maybe to Jon, it would take something

00:10:31.529 --> 00:10:35.769
more for everyone else in Westeros to find
out. If Jon was to make a claim on the Throne

00:10:35.769 --> 00:10:40.029
as a Targaryen, he would need more than the
word of a tree-boy to back him up, and as

00:10:40.029 --> 00:10:44.699
suggested before, Howland Reed as High
Sparrow would be well-placed to do that.

00:10:44.699 --> 00:10:50.869
So HS=HR doesn’t have any strong evidence,
and is pretty implausible in a bunch of ways.

00:10:50.869 --> 00:10:54.679
There are some tantalising facts that kinda
back it up, but all of those facts are still

00:10:54.679 --> 00:10:58.999
compatible with the simpler explanation, that
Howland is still in the North, and that the

00:10:58.999 --> 00:11:05.999
High Sparrow is just what he seems. So HS=HR
is a cool theory, but it’s probably not true.

00:11:07.059 --> 00:11:09.670
Thanks for watching, subscribe if you want

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:09.920
to see more.

